1. Aggregate Functions 
Aggreagate function perform calculations on multiple rows and return a single value.

    COUNT() rows count
    SUM()   total value 
    AVG()   
    MAX()
    MIN() 

    SELECT * from emp;

    select count(*) from emp;

    select sum(sal) from emp;

    SELECT AVG(sal) from emp;

    SELECT MAX(sal) from emp;

    SELECT MIN(sal) from emp;

